# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git) and fill in to turn on Google sign-in in the playground.
#
# A Google OAuth 2.0 client ID of type "Web application", from Google Cloud Console →
# APIs & Services → Credentials. Its "Authorized JavaScript origins" must list every
# address the playground runs on, e.g. http://localhost:5180 and the deployed site.
# A client ID isn't a secret; never put a client secret here.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
